## Problem
During model download (which can take 5-15 minutes for large models), there's no progress indication. Operators don't know if download is stuck or progressing.

## Implementation Details

This is more complex as it requires either:
A) Modifying storage-initializer to report progress (upstream change)
B) Creating a custom init container that reports progress
C) Monitoring download progress from operator via pod exec/logs

### Recommended Approach: Custom sidecar that monitors download

1. Add progress-monitor sidecar to InferenceService pod:
```go
// In inferenceservice builder
func (b *InferenceServiceBuilder) addProgressMonitor() {
    b.podSpec.Containers = append(b.podSpec.Containers, corev1.Container{
        Name:  "progress-monitor",
        Image: "ghcr.io/otherjamesbrown/ai-aas/progress-monitor:latest",
        VolumeMounts: []corev1.VolumeMount{{
            Name:      "model-volume",
            MountPath: "/mnt/models",
            ReadOnly:  true,
        }},
        Env: []corev1.EnvVar{{
            Name:  "EXPECTED_SIZE_BYTES",
            Value: aimodel.Spec.ExpectedModelSize,  // New field
        }, {
            Name:  "STATUS_ENDPOINT",
            Value: "http://admin-api-service:8080/internal/model-progress",
        }},
    })
}
```

2. Progress monitor reports to Admin API:
```go
// services/progress-monitor/main.go
func monitorDownload() {
    ticker := time.NewTicker(5 * time.Second)
    for range ticker.C {
        size := getDirSize("/mnt/models")
        progress := float64(size) / float64(expectedSize) * 100

        reportProgress(Progress{
            ModelName:  modelName,
            Downloaded: humanize.Bytes(uint64(size)),
            Total:      humanize.Bytes(uint64(expectedSize)),
            Percentage: int(progress),
        })
    }
}
```

3. Operator fetches progress from Admin API and updates status

### Alternative: Parse storage-initializer logs
Less accurate but simpler - count files downloaded vs expected files.

### Testing
- Unit test: Progress calculation
- Integration test: Deploy model, verify progress updates

### Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Download progress shown as percentage
- [ ] Downloaded/total bytes shown
- [ ] Updates every 5-10 seconds during download

